error[B0218]: `max-length` is not an HTML attribute
  --> t.beck:108:100
    |
108 |             input(aria_label="what needs doing?", placeholder="what needs doing?", autofocus="on", max_length="80",
    |                                                                                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `input` would carry this to the browser, which ignores it
    |
  = note: an attribute of your own is spelled `data_…`, which is HTML's own extension point and reaches the page as `data-…`
  = help: did you mean `maxlength`?
